 (649 has a single event in the window and 2121 a single inbound partner). Temporal localisation shows the hops fire out of order: 649->3767 at ~[24315,24714], but 3767->556 only at ~[25715,25914] while 556->1001 already occurred at ~[25515,25714], and 1001->3569 (~[24715,25114]) and 3569->2121 (~[25115,25314]) both precede those. Influence from 649 could not have reached 2121 before its inbound event, and no 600-unit-gap time-respecting ordering exists. The ordered tail into 2121 is instead fed by 612->1001, a source not reachable from 649.", "evidence": [{"trace_id": "step_01", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_02", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_03", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_04", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_07", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_08", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_09", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_10", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_11", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_12", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_13", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_14", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_15", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_16", "role": "support"}]}, "raw_final_response": "## Analysis\n\n**Structure (time ignored):** There is exactly one candidate path, and it is a forced chain \u2014 every node has a single relevant out/in neighbour:\n\n`649 \u2192 3767 \u2192 556 \u2192 1001 \u2192 3569 \u2192 2121` (steps 03, 04, 07, 08, 09, 10)\n\n649 has only 1 event in the whole window (step_02), so no alternate start exists; 2121 has only one in-neighbour, 3569 (step_04).\n\n**Timing (bucket localisation, steps 11\u201316):**\n\n| event | time bucket |\n|---|---|\n| 649 \u2192 3767 | [24315, 24714] |\n| 612 \u2192 1001 (not from 649) | [24315, 24714] |\n| 1001 \u2192 3569 | [24715, 25114] |\n| 3569 \u2192 2121 | [25115, 25314] |\n| **556 \u2192 1001** | **[25515, 25714]** |\n| **3767 \u2192 556** | **[25715, 25914]** |\n\nThe last two hops of the only path occur **after** the target already received its single inbound event. The path is anti-temporal: 556\u21921001 precedes 3767\u2192556 by ~200 units in the wrong direction, and 1001\u21923569\u21922121 both fire ~400\u2013900 units *before* influence could have reached 1001 from 649's branch.\n\n**Confounder control:** 1001's other in-edge (612, step_10) is what plausibly feeds 1001\u21923569\u21922121 in correct order, but 612 is unreachable from 649 (649's sole out-edge is 3767, step_03). So the ordered sub-chain into 2121 has an origin independent of 649. Static connectivity here is a pure artifact of ignoring time.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_759f6f54\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [649, 3767, 556, 1001, 3569, 2121],\n  \"window\": [20315, 29914],\n  \"confidence\": 0.85,\n  \"narrative\": \"The only static path from 649 to 2121 is the forced chain 649->3767->556->1001->3569->2121 (649 has a single event in the window and 2121 a single inbound partner). Temporal localisation shows the hops fire out of order: 649->3767 at ~[24315,24714], but 3767->556 only at ~[25715,25914] while 556->1001 already occurred at ~[25515,25714], and 1001->3569 (~[24715,25114]) and 3569->2121 (~[25115,25314]) both precede those. Influence from 649 could not have reached 2121 before its inbound event, and no 600-unit-gap time-respecting ordering exists. The ordered tail into 2121 is instead fed by 612->1001, a source not reachable from 649.\",\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_08\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_09\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_10\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_11\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_12\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_13\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_14\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_15\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_16\", \"role\": \"support\"}\n  ]\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 28008, "total_output_tokens": 6462, "total_tokens": 34470, "total_latency_ms": 83581, "llm_calls": 6, "schema_repairs": 0, "tool_protocol_errors": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}